Title: Audit Log Retrieval API for Global Accounts in the Cloud Foundry Environment
Heading path: Audit Log Retrieval API for Global Accounts in the Cloud Foundry Environment > Create Instance of the `auditlog-management` Service

        ```
        cf create-service auditlog-management central <SERVICE_INSTANCE> -c '{
            "xs-security": {
                "xsappname": "auditlog",
                "oauth2-configuration": {
                    "credential-types": [
                        "x509"
                    ],
                    "grant-types": [
                        "client_credentials"
                    ]
                }
            }
        }'
        ```

Title: Audit Log Retrieval API for Global Accounts in the Cloud Foundry Environment
Heading path: Audit Log Retrieval API for Global Accounts in the Cloud Foundry Environment > Create Instance of the `auditlog-management` Service

        ```
        cf create-service-key <SERVICE_INSTANCE> <SERVICE_KEY> -c '{
            "xsuaa": {
                "credential-type": "x509",
                "x509": {
                    "key-length": 2048,
                    "validity": 1,
                    "validity-type": "DAYS"
                }
            }
        }'
        ```

